- Global view toggle (Summary | Notes | Highlights | Branches)
- Flat branch model (no nested expand/collapse)
- Inline AI summaries, notes, highlights per row
- Interactive count badges with per-row override
- Topics column replacing Size column
- De-emphasis of empty rows in filtered views
- Click target zones for navigation vs interaction

**Step 10 (Highlights, Notes, Favorites)** is now partially designed:
